Package: impactstandin
Type: Package
Title: Stand-In for the Model Package in the 'docker_setup' Tests
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("IMPACT Docker GUI", "tests", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "tests@example.org")
Description: A tiny package with one compiled function. The tests build and install it
    the way the model's Dockerfile builds the real model package, and install it again
    from an RStudio session to prove that the R library stays writable.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
